receiver, by such administrator or receiver;
(d)
owned, possessed, held or controlled by a person whose properties are under the management or a Court of Wards, by
the manger of such Court;
(e)
vested in an executor or an administrator of a will or other testamentary disposition, by such executor or administrator;
(f)
owned, possessed, held or controlled by the members of a firm, by any partner of such firm;
(g)
owned, possessed, held or controlled by a Hindu Undivided Family, by the head or karta or such family;
(h)
